- **DO-ART-902** (evidence plate, section 2) ΓÇö screen exhibit + specification panel
- **DO-ART-202** (measure plate, section 4) ΓÇö bar charts quantifying supplier pipeline
- **DO-ART-302** (ladder plate, section 5) ΓÇö three-rung buy/buy-plus/full-custom diagram with animateMotion
